# Hermes secrets — TEMPLATE ONLY (names, no values).
# Real file: ~/.hermes/.env on the host. NEVER commit it. NEVER reuse your personal
# or main-machine secrets here — these must be DEDICATED, marketing-account-only creds.

# --- LLM brain (Step 1) ---
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# --- X / @orai_intern (channel-connection step — NOT Step 1) ---
# How Hermes publishes to X is decided in the channel step. Note: X is our PUBLISHING
# target, not a chat "gateway". Likely a skill/tool using the X API with dedicated creds.
# X_API_KEY=
# X_API_SECRET=
# X_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# X_ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET=

# --- Telegram (likely the chat GATEWAY = how you message the agent; later) ---
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=

# --- Notion hub, dedicated agent identity (Step 2) ---
# NOTION_API_KEY=
